          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Is there a number that cannot be represented in our base-5 system above? Why or why not?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.711,
            0.794,
            0.732
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Yes, zero (0) is the number, because there is no symbol for it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.748,
            0.847,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Compute the landmark numbers of a base-7 system. In general, what are the landmark numbers of a base-n system?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.793,
            0.504,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7^{0}=1, 7^{1}=7, 7^{2}=49, 7^{3}=343,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.813,
            0.847,
            0.873
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hence 1, 7, 49, 343, … are landmark numbers of base-7. The landmark numbers of a base-n system are, the powers of the n starting from "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { 0 } , n ^ { 1 } , n ^ { 2 } , n ^ { 3 } \\ldots"
            }
          ]
        },
